oh and btw "yizz.net" is me, don't have to
ask me about it.... :)

(i registered it because i tried to complain
about how i registered "yizX.net" because
"yizz.net" was taken, so i ran WHOIS(1) and
the result was like a not-found.  i was in
denial, so i looked it up on porkbun...

the rest is history. :x (apparently it expired,
some time after November 2023... because i
could have sworn it was not available!))

apparently (according to yours truly, Internet
Archive), yizz.net was short for 易站长, which
is a lot sweeter than... whatever the f**k
yizx.net stood for to be serving those VODs. ^^;
(it's also not permanently blacklisted by GFW
at the TCP packet level, so yippee....)

(for those who don't speak chinese, "站长"
quite literally spells out webmaster.  or at
least, i think... site administrator broadly.)
